{"time": 1766251825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246700754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（希望）"}
{"time": 1766251842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371460850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我知道芊神是不考了)"}
{"time": 1766251850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "414624471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他是考华工吧，）"}
{"time": 1766251906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733808330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是）"}
{"time": 1766251924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114025161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=15800393]\"诶?我们身上现在没有钱了吗？\"她摸了摸自己的口袋，当然没有钱，\"呃...那我们还是...走吧?\"从好奇瞬间收敛，囊中羞涩的样子。"}
{"time": 1766252056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313262589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……学院里应该，也还是有贫困生的吧？”有些颓丧，自己也不是很喜欢惺惺作态“至少还有这些面包”"}
{"time": 1766252223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886073351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1215853247]再次醒来已经天黑，不过黑夜对你而言不成影响，你发现自己已经被挪动了位置，放在了柔软的床上，旁边也没有人。"}
{"time": 1766252290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6205206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "揉揉眼睛，西莉丝姐姐呢...心里顿时警铃大作，西莉丝姐姐不会是生自己的气离开了吧，立刻起身，试图寻找她的痕迹"}
{"time": 1766252528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288632990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=313262589]\"嗯...\"她规规矩矩做好，你感觉甚至有些做贼心虚，抬手从桌子上拿了两块面包，抹上蓝莓的果酱递给你，\"嗯...感觉有点...是不是不太好...\""}
{"time": 1766252567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768645666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=6205206]她静静坐在窗边，也许听到了你的动静，但依然一动不动，不知道在想什么"}
{"time": 1766252608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097304011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "慢慢移动到她的身旁"}
{"time": 1766252759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955227025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐之前去哪了...为什么会伤的那么重....”"}
{"time": 1766252902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97208251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明明说好的不会有什么事...”"}
{"time": 1766252947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51884039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"晚上...也看得清呢...\"她没有回答你的问题，开口的话里透着份寂寞感，眼睛看着窗外的尖塔"}
{"time": 1766252947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166492354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=288632990]“大不了，之后再补上就是了。总不能不吃”为了消解她的疑虑，大大方方拿起一块咬下"}
{"time": 1766253223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790305581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=166492354]\"嗯...\"看着你吃得大大方方，她也跟着咬起来，果酱鲜甜，似乎经过了特殊的处理，此外，面包本身也谈得上松软，应当是今天新做的"}
{"time": 1766253263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610252996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=51884039]“我.....”"}
{"time": 1766253275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399486993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会陪着西莉丝姐姐的....”"}
{"time": 1766253374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1278463088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来……我本来就是嘉宾嘛”越吃越觉得有胃口，不过还是没敢太放肆“这点面包算什么”"}
{"time": 1766253523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925398397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1399486993]\"...\"她的目光落到你的脸上，你看到她微张的尖牙，原本娴静的蓝瞳被染成竖着的红瞳，此刻没有带上什么感情，\"我该...怎么面对?\""}
{"time": 1766253554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711596285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（私奔的好机会啊）"}
{"time": 1766253563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773302121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1278463088]\"说起来...\"妃花连续吃了好几片才停下，指指桌上的另一种小菜，\"这是什么?\""}
{"time": 1766253567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874521394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh）"}
{"time": 1766253621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36031652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1711596285]（她肯定还有家族之类的吧）"}
{"time": 1766253675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919016826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（难道回得去吗）"}
{"time": 1766253713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043744967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她现在见不了人也怕自己伤害别人）"}
{"time": 1766253719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420099452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不就该远走高飞了）"}
{"time": 1766253742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965800035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=925398397]...不知道，自己也不知道该怎么办，但这一切都是自己造成的..上前抱住西莉丝“我会和姐姐一起的,永远...”"}
{"time": 1766253879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891345672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=965800035]金色的秀发披散在身后，质感出奇地好，她的目光再度移开，\"诺诺...能做什么？\""}
{"time": 1766253953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438046268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=773302121]“不知道，虽然，摆在餐厅应该无毒？”"}
{"time": 1766253972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863851508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“能陪着姐姐....”艰难的说出这几个字，再一次感觉到了自己的无力“也许还有逆转的可能呢...我会和姐姐一起去找”"}
{"time": 1766254100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549069801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "事已至此，沾起一点尝尝看"}
{"time": 1766254253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244711050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1863851508]\"逆转...?\"她轻轻笑了一声，你感觉心如刀割，\"我不知道...我其实...已经快接受了吧？\"她低头看着自己的手心，\"我应该死掉才好。\""}
{"time": 1766254268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788970172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1549069801]咸咸的口感，脆脆的"}
{"time": 1766254276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575108309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实是魔法小纯)"}
{"time": 1766254289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005617972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(饭堂的免费小菜)"}
{"time": 1766254302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983277510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1766254333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407173735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要...不可以..求求了...”眼泪止不住的流出“不要丢下我....一个人...”"}
{"time": 1766254367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692181634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“萝卜干啊……和这种软面包不是很搭，算了”放弃小菜，还是果酱更对一点"}
{"time": 1766254598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973087026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=407173735]\"...\"她的侧脸如同刀割，始终没有变化，只是微微闭上了眼"}
{"time": 1766254692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979885431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1692181634]\"哦～\"倒是妃花给自己的面包添了许多免费小菜，\"酸甜口吃多了很腻吧？还是这种好啦。\"不过再怎么说，比起四周的学生的山珍海味，你们显得过于落魄了"}
{"time": 1766254777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927467573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不...不要这样，西莉丝姐姐打我骂我都好...让我做什么都行，别这样..我好害怕，害怕彻底失去姐姐...”"}
{"time": 1766254922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012357534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1979885431]“偶尔一次还行啦。”心中暗叹一口“明天得尽早去学生会了。”"}
{"time": 1766255182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302255472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1012357534]\"妃花倒是觉得...还好?\"她眨了眨眼，放下面包，\"比村子里吃得好多啦，而且...很真实。\""}
{"time": 1766255340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249885149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只是这种程度的话，我家里想做多少就能做多少啦”不过想起来自己现在负债累累，没法笑得由衷“不吃肉的话，总觉得少些什么”"}
{"time": 1766255392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209411199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(和你这种给小羊套皮筋绝育的人没什么好说的)"}
{"time": 1766255454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051485184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1927467573]\"我要做什么...?\"她摇摇头，\"我不想做什么...什么都不想。\""}
{"time": 1766255645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475786809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了（）"}
{"time": 1766255664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407875909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1766255737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186326531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(火车上也睡得着?)"}
{"time": 1766275582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033304775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1249885149]\"嗯...妃花逢年过节的时候才能吃到肉呢...\"她放下面包，似乎在回味，\"啊...不过在现在倒是经常能吃到。\"说完点了点脑袋"}
{"time": 1766275680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452787628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔……说起来，虽然好像有点冒昧”犹豫了一会“妃花活的时间应该，比看上去久？”"}
{"time": 1766276525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666400390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=452787628]\"嗯...\"她点了点头，\"虽然有些没印象，不过睡着之前，嗯...王国应该还不是现在这个皇帝呢？\"随后她看向你，\"嘛，怎么了?\""}
{"time": 1766278455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873021449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（今天下午吃什么）"}
