{"time": 1766280306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705519848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1642809137]“宿舍吧，毕竟校服都在身上了”感觉吃的差不多了，下意识想起身"}
{"time": 1766280378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936249489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1213861191]\"...\"她收起目光，\"诺诺应该知道我在说什么才对——我不能就此离开...\""}
{"time": 1766280417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037417952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1705519848]一起身，重量压下，左腿立刻钻心地疼"}
{"time": 1766280670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710145573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘶……”双手赶紧扶住轮椅扶手，又跌回轮椅上“再、再坐会吧”"}
{"time": 1766280824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688086236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=710145573]妃花连忙检查一下你的状态，\"啊...果然不行吧...还是给妃花比较好...妃花都习惯了。\"她的脸上带着些自责"}
{"time": 1766280946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298202466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1936249489][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “那我们先去把莎木纳克雅解决了吧。。。。”"}
