{"time": 1766426794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068882985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=983338693]也许是水土不服，又也许是经受了刺激，或是睡眠不足？但是毫无征兆地，你的左腿开始刺痛起来，并且似乎有些愈演愈烈。"}
{"time": 1766427035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090130470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（抽筋了（）"}
