{"time": 1766483693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916328149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不太对）"}
{"time": 1766483701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117864952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1081428497][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 变小脱身!"}
{"time": 1766483920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134958133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117864952](我在想)"}
{"time": 1766483925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352448357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你变小我也变小)"}
{"time": 1766484036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21306828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=6742739]\"好啦好啦～\"她回过身摸摸你的脑袋，\"毕竟是可爱的妹妹，不调戏一下很不舒服诶?\"你感觉到清凉的感觉从头顶开始，一直蔓延全身，随之而来的是一阵舒爽，左腿的诅咒也暂时销声匿迹"}
{"time": 1766484107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140308841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来轮椅还是酒店的）"}
{"time": 1766484459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883664819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117864952]蛛网抓了个空，但手上的利剑也随之掉落，不过倒是破开了不少下坠路线上的蛛丝"}
{"time": 1766484531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297289054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“诺亚别怕...”重新飞上高空，艾尔前辈拜托了，心里这样想着，将希望寄托在花环上"}
{"time": 1766484620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704171732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1297289054]同时以血御剑，尝试远程操控去切断诺亚周围的蛛网，但这么密密麻麻的，感觉一把剑不太够用"}
{"time": 1766484633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216643511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=21306828]一时说不出话来，掀开被子看看宿管和妃花什么情况"}
{"time": 1766484764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531733993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1704171732](以血御剑?彳亍)"}
{"time": 1766484836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125940608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1216643511]宿管已经不在室内，倒是妃花，盖着厚厚的冬被，睡得小脸通红"}
{"time": 1766485018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384805112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1704171732]\"不用管我...\"诺亚的身影几乎被灰白色的蛛丝淹没，你只听见她的声音，平稳，一如平常，\"诺亚只是人偶，所以没关系\""}
{"time": 1766485061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785771008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1125940608]“……算了。我的学生证呢？”坐回轮椅上，对她伸手"}
{"time": 1766485138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497642527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行...诺亚就是诺亚，不管诺亚是什么，反正把你单独丢在这里我做不到”"}
{"time": 1766485212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14214261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（云裂之剑）"}
{"time": 1766485216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083522160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当断则断）"}
{"time": 1766485252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128197364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是我我就，先去直捣黄龙）"}
{"time": 1766485305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727172102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（去哪黄龙呢，怎么知道节点的优先级呢，至于破坏此处的节点，那也得先把诺亚拉出来）"}
{"time": 1766485406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899825722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（主要是之前不多的时候都没拉出来）"}
{"time": 1766485767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522387096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=785771008]\"妹妹想好取什么名字了吗？\"她的表情有些好笑，就像真的在看着自家任性的妹妹一样"}
{"time": 1766485786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059836394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（叫卡提希娅你不是炸了）"}
{"time": 1766485828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554664452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497642527]\"...\"她没接话，或者...已经接不了话，在你眼中，地表以上全部已成蠕动的蛛网"}
{"time": 1766485886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234723712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看样子，想救出诺亚，只能去破坏这里的节点了，看看哪里的蛛网密度最大"}
{"time": 1766485898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190150040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“syndra”不管她的视线，自己的诉求不会改变"}
{"time": 1766486130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668757150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可达鸭?)"}
{"time": 1766486262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923389358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（辛德拉）"}
{"time": 1766486313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257536815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那不就是可达鸭)"}
{"time": 1766486396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680504937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=234723712]墙壁上，地表上都会钻出蛛丝，在高空中倒是一览无遗...与其说，哪里的密度最大，不如说，这里本是就是那一处节点，就像在，执法官的小屋底下..."}
{"time": 1766486670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544996987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=190150040]\"为什么?\"她的手指移到你的脸上捏了捏，\"我家可没有灰姑娘诶?\""}
{"time": 1766486743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198997710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你又要问。”翻个白眼“你想怎么叫就怎么叫吧”"}
{"time": 1766486978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18498643", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啊，那就叫卡尔萨斯。\"她对你伸出手，\"还不起床?哦，起沙发?\""}
{"time": 1766487151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875267621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（卡尔萨斯是？）"}
{"time": 1766487163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079879471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=785771008]（已经在轮椅了）"}
{"time": 1766487270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287010636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1766487314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299015738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啊，那就叫卡尔萨斯。\"她松开你的脸，\"这下满意了吧?\""}
{"time": 1766487501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737658151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“证……”有些没脾气，终究是拿人手短，只得叹了口气"}
{"time": 1766487646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677457322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1680504937]如果诺亚不在的话，还能考虑用火烧，但现在只能寄希望于自己的精神力上了"}
{"time": 1766487655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787207390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她笑着摇摇头，递给你两张叠在一起的证件，\"逗你的啦，像这种东西，姐姐改多少都不是问题。\""}
{"time": 1766487809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057610025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "花环，花环，尝试去使用"}
{"time": 1766487931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692082769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=787207390]“是不是太压抑了，你。”一时之间有些生不起气来，拿过两张证件看看“是有多想要个妹妹？”"}
{"time": 1766488166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814597346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2057610025]可是，该怎么用呢？"}
