{"time": 1766512955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619883610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=939989261]倒是习惯了她卖关子，懒得计较了“拜拜，有事再说”"}
{"time": 1766513015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871133069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=619883610]她倒是没有接话，自己离开了。宿管也没有回来，此刻只剩下你和妃花两人。"}
{"time": 1766513029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134205922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1240510954]无人应答，沉默...唯有沉默"}
{"time": 1766513254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081647094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....别啊，我应该没招惹你吧.. 里谢娜姐姐说你们不是和吉尔内莉莎关系不好么...”嘴里小声嘟囔着，继续朝酒店走..自己现在也只能做这些了"}
{"time": 1766513487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036107525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2081647094]无人应答，无人应声，雾气渐浓，直到没过你的胸口，沉闷的触感瞬间压在胸腔上"}
