{"time": 1766514526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828231821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=693557446]\"嗯...\"她的脸颊有些红，橘色的头发自然地披散在脑后，此刻朱唇轻吐，半睁开一边的眼睛，随后又轻轻闭上，\"困...\""}
{"time": 1766514898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816913990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=862622733]理所当然不行，甚至还消耗了些本就不多的魔力"}
{"time": 1766514938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76408865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1828231821]“早，房间的事解决了，要不要去床上休息？”"}
{"time": 1766514996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1132448234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "可恶...自己每次都会在关键时刻掉链子...该怎么办啊 用花环的话，魔力现在也不够...对了...感知西莉丝姐姐的位置，标记加上作为自己的血裔，应该还是能做到的"}
{"time": 1766515009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423839423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "朝着那个方向一直走"}
{"time": 1766515384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588576725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=76408865]\"沙发...好软诶...\"她动了动腰，连带着杯子也抖了抖，\"不想动...\"语气松软散漫，眼睛都没睁开。"}
