{"time": 1766515896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466273401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1728736074]虽然方向大致没有问题，但是...走了许久，也许你体感了半个小时之久，你仍未抵达酒店"}
{"time": 1766515951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237636353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么还没到。。。”诺亚是个人偶大概是现在最好的消息了，不过这么长时间魔力应该也恢复的差不多了吧...风加以太再试试"}
{"time": 1766515967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718747183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=588576725]“好吧，那就再睡会”摸摸她的脑袋"}
{"time": 1766516192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099762866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=718747183]\"嗯呢...\"轻声呢喃，\"伊芙...先去忙...待会...\"还没说完她的话就停了下来，替换成了绵长的呼吸音。"}
{"time": 1766516242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963814386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=237636353]也许吹散了一小范围的雾，但你眼见愈来愈多的雾气正在从远处蔓延而来"}
