{"time": 1766544101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10474576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（上北下南左西右东，往东）"}
{"time": 1766544530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35072585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走了大约五分钟，你或许是看见了此行的目的地，本身和刚刚看见的宿舍楼并无不同，不同的是门面上装饰着一些燃烧的火焰。站在301房的门口，雕花的木门，正正经经地嵌着锁孔。"}
{"time": 1766544776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768688900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“火焰，好像不太对？”心里一阵嘀咕，但是先试试看能不能刷开门"}
{"time": 1766545095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525353809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "蓝宝石在你手中化成了一枚晶莹剔透的闪着蓝光的钥匙，看上去倒是严丝合缝"}
{"time": 1766545172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475631930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那就进行一个开"}
{"time": 1766545460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509054145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=475631930]里面的房间倒是陈设简单，看上去就是很普通的四人间上床下桌的样子，但出于某些原因，只有一个座位和床位上摆放了私人物品"}
{"time": 1766545568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509341437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎呀哎呀，总算轮到我来看你的房间了。”虽然卡珊德拉不在，但是对着空气这么说道。先收拾出两个床铺来，然后毫无心理负担地翻翻看卡珊德拉的东西"}
{"time": 1766546083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046947777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1393062142]（so？你在问谁）"}
{"time": 1766546093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121050232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我教你，用土元素把自己顶起来）"}
{"time": 1766546201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102490334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "积攒魔力 随后以太风环绕自身，向上飞"}
