{"time": 1766596441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485763295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我被鲁鲁纳伊的雾气困住了...”"}
{"time": 1766596568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789034598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1485763295]\"只是这样?\"一滴鲜血从你的伤口渗出，滴在空气上，\"你做过什么?\"就像是日常的询问"}
{"time": 1766596639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909441367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我跟诺亚去调查节点...然后出现了很多蛛网，我用了一个前辈给我的道具，然后我就带诺亚跑..”事无巨细一五一十的讲发生了什么“然后就被雾气包围了”"}
{"time": 1766597046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993126675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1909441367]\"哦，就这样?\"血液浮在你的面前"}
{"time": 1766597070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617055038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...帮帮我吧，斑比大人..”双手合十"}
{"time": 1766597694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333010782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1617055038]\"那你想好，给我什么东西了吗？\""}
{"time": 1766597806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993561718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”戳戳手指“好像我也没什么可以给斑比酱了....”至于花环，先不谈她看不看得上，对抗节点自己还需要用，无奈的摇了摇头...“对不起。。。。”"}
{"time": 1766597884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226691018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，这次就算我心情好。\"她打了个哈欠的样子，\"回头走，懂吗?\""}
{"time": 1766597936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788542510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢斑比大人..谢谢斑比大人..”疯狂鞠躬感谢，甚至想给她磕几个头"}
{"time": 1766598302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553907847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1788542510]\"...\"你几乎能感觉到她皱起的眉头，\"没必要，不过...\""}
{"time": 1766598327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781670082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过？”停下自己的动作"}
{"time": 1766598396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705527756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在那里面方向感不一定正确，背着身走，如果你刚刚一直往前\""}
{"time": 1766598452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080307959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢斑比大人提醒...”背身向后走"}
{"time": 1766599158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744082226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2080307959]\"唉...没有我你可怎么办啊。\""}
{"time": 1766599371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748113529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2080307959]走了一阵，你似乎...走回了那个节点"}
{"time": 1766599495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971830654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=748113529][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 雾气是个什么情况"}
{"time": 1766599804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813159798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "逐渐散去"}
{"time": 1766599827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613776291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好奇怪..”起飞朝酒店飞去"}
{"time": 1766599932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465810697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(别急)"}
{"time": 1766600350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734829765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1613776291]当你起身飞远，雾气再次从四周围过来"}
{"time": 1766600378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240182840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦？...”何意味，不破坏节点不给走吗"}
{"time": 1766600396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712906705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看蛛丝烧的怎么样了"}
{"time": 1766600545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904009181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有一些裸露在外的地方被烧成了灰烬，但大多完好无损"}
{"time": 1766600598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263869792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "火为什么不会蔓延呢.. 有些懊恼，背着诺亚看看周围的建筑物"}
{"time": 1766600708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477271588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"单纯的破坏当然是没有用的。\"斑比的话语插入，\"这里是什么地方显而易见吧？\""}
{"time": 1766600753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167365413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这里是法师塔....斑比酱的意思是，这里有阵法保护？”"}
{"time": 1766600870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56024183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"节点，我说的是节点啦。\"她的声音有些无语"}
{"time": 1766600878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141061746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要找到源头吧）"}
{"time": 1766600884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117021204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不然治标不治本）"}
{"time": 1766601039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056119692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦，原来斑比酱是这个意思啊，我也在找节点的位置啦..感觉看起来像是在地下的样子，所以我想看看周围有没有什么可以下去的地方 ”去一座法师塔看看情况"}
{"time": 1766601359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337457011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1056119692]“真是的，第一次处理这种事情？”伤口上溅出几滴鲜血，笼罩在你的周身，“你得先伪装成它们的同类才行，在这里应该很容易办到吧？又是花冠又是戒指的。”"}
{"time": 1766601418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751140606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？是我考虑不周了，谢谢斑比提醒..不过它们的同类，是那种黑色的吗”"}
{"time": 1766601448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44236144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(黑色的是啥)"}
{"time": 1766601466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352955661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那些被诅咒的绝望的人）"}
{"time": 1766601604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315826142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不需要那么彻底，我已经帮你做了。\"血液化成了薄雾，\"你只要让它们相信就好。\""}
{"time": 1766601637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209065745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢斑比大人..”心里生出了浓浓的感激之情"}
