{"time": 1766630585, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1055498580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[芭芙娜]演奏出: 1D20=8"}
{"time": 1766630899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856090197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=782670488]\"诶...\"她眨了眨眼，\"嘛，那说不定，可以遇见学姐...嗯，学姐可能不太行吧?\""}
{"time": 1766630953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876724276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是该回忆一下领带的颜色了）"}
