{"time": 1766635583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467157255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=703073937]依旧是向上的螺旋楼梯和小巧的活板门，你也并非第一次见了"}
{"time": 1766636030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680071942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "打开活板门看看"}
