{"time": 1766636240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653419062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“断...断手...”有些惊讶，是原版的主人吗"}
