{"time": 1766636271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301070607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1595514376][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 寻找一下蛛丝的来源"}
{"time": 1766636635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218778672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1301070607]看样子似乎是左手，被四方八面墙壁，地面，天花板透出的蛛丝紧紧缠着，缝隙中滴落血珠。"}
{"time": 1766636696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351691766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还在滴血...不会是刚死的吧..”不过其实也还好，自己的体力也消耗了不少“斑比酱，这个能尝一口吗”"}
{"time": 1766636720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505479536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉看着有点像陷阱的样子”"}
{"time": 1766636737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981626025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=588842621]采购倒是没花多长时间，具体要买什么？"}
{"time": 1766636836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486036253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "纸笔，换洗校服，剪刀，小手提包，洗漱用品"}
{"time": 1766636915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225713187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不会是那种捕鼠夹之类的东西吧...”"}
{"time": 1766636938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644348432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不是有精神利刃）"}
