{"time": 1766637274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503155450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "咽了咽口水，有点想尝一口，但这个环境还是太诡异了"}
{"time": 1766637274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706647072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=351691766]\"随便。\"她的声音过了一会才出现，\"已经死了。\""}
{"time": 1766637358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659455787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "回去放下东西，就去炼金巢室呗"}
{"time": 1766637382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431108244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（教室应该也在那边吧）"}
{"time": 1766637409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497593009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的，谢谢斑比酱”使用以太利刃把断手从蜘蛛网上取下，然后干净起见，再用水元素冲一冲，随后再拿刀划开一个口子，享受一下血的味道“我收集一些回去带给斑比酱？”"}
{"time": 1766637434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186999475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "心里这样想着，然后美美饮血"}
{"time": 1766637587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027981254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不要，这种充当祭品的血...不好喝。\"喝下口确实稍微涩了点，和你目前喝过的血比起来，确实品质稍差。"}
{"time": 1766637641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30254986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他喝过几个人的啊.jpg）"}
{"time": 1766637670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481387192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(爱璃西雅，西里斯，斑比)"}
{"time": 1766637682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038677388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“祭品？节点的创建需要什么仪式吗...”和动物血相比已经是仙品了，美美享受"}
{"time": 1766637715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159585180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1431108244](显然，不在)"}
{"time": 1766637742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160573961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "差不多之后，把手臂小心的放在地上，拜一拜，然后再往更高处看看"}
{"time": 1766637743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817431343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那边是工位，是单间为主，教学楼是独立的)"}
{"time": 1766637804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359332178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659455787]这里依然是之前那副样子，哦，或者说，是你记忆里那副样子，变化有，但很少。像是蜂巢一样的格子间，遍布各种各样乱七八糟的声响。\"诶...这地方真的有教室吗？\""}
