{"time": 1766637927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858697635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好像走错了，这边是实验楼……”有点尴尬“那不就是快迟到了吗？不妙……”拉着妃花认路牌，往教学楼跑"}
{"time": 1766637954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697186812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=633027199]（咦，难道说还有拼高达环节？）"}
{"time": 1766637975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759421367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(纤纤玉手)"}
{"time": 1766638138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153155067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看样子只要把所有的祭品全都拆了，节点就破碎了？斑比酱，我是不是不能闹出太大的动静啊”在想直接起飞的事情，看看法师塔顶层有没有窗户"}
{"time": 1766638498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284370642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=153155067]\"不想被发现的话。\""}
